<title>USA: Stentex Venture names president.</title>
<headline>Stentex Venture names president.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>StenTex LLC, a 50-50 joint venture between Texaco Inc and Stena Line AB, Friday said Mats Berglund has been named president,  effective May 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Berglund most recently served as Vice President and Treasurer of StenTex.</p>
<p>He succeeds Charles Parks, who has been appointed Vice President of Business Development and New Projects at Universe Tankships, a unit of Concordia Maritime AB.</p>
</text>
